- @page_title = t('settings')

/! Settings → Help: Report a problem, this server in a few lines, and its logs (help.js switches
/! them, fetching each from help_log the first time its tab is opened).
.kai-help
  .row.g-4
    .col-lg-5
      .card.mb-4.kai-help-report
        .card-header.bg-dark.text-white
          h5.mb-0
            span.me-2 = lucide_icon('help-circle', size: 18)
            | Something not working?
        .card-body
          p
            | Tell us what happened. Amahi-kai adds this server's details and its recent logs, with names and
              addresses taken out, and shows you all of it before anything is sent.
          a.btn.btn-primary#report-a-problem href="/settings/help/report" Report a problem
          p.small.text-muted.mt-3.mb-0
            | How-tos and answers are in the
            =< link_to 'wiki', 'https://amahi-kai.com/wiki/', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
            | . A security problem goes privately:
            =< link_to 'report a vulnerability', 'https://github.com/CatDogBark/Amahi-kai/security/advisories/new', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
            | .

      .card.mb-4
        .card-header.bg-dark.text-white
          h5.mb-0
            span.me-2 = lucide_icon('server', size: 18)
            | This server
        .card-body
          dl.kai-help-summary.mb-0
            - @summary.each do |label, value|
              dt = label
              dd = value

    .col-lg-7
      .card
        .card-header.bg-dark.text-white.d-flex.justify-content-between.align-items-center.flex-wrap.gap-2
          h5.mb-0
            span.me-2 = lucide_icon('file-text', size: 18)
            | Logs
          a.btn.btn-sm.btn-outline-light.d-inline-flex.align-items-center.gap-1 href=settings_help_logs_path download=""
            = lucide_icon('download', size: 15)
            | Download logs
        .card-body
          .kai-help-sources role="tablist" aria-label="Which log"
            - @log_sources.each_with_index do |source, index|
              button.kai-help-source type="button" role="tab" aria-selected=(index.zero? ? 'true' : 'false') aria-controls="help-log" data-log-source=source.key data-log-about=source.about
                = source.label
          p.small.text-muted.mt-3.mb-2#help-log-about = @log_sources.first.about
          pre.kai-help-log#help-log role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" data-log-url=settings_help_log_path aria-live="polite"
            = @first_log.join("\n").presence || '(empty)'
